{"user": "Ok, I got it.  So it seems like b7 or c8 is probably the best move because they will flip 5 white discs for me.", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T12:39:19.021378+00:00", "assistant": "Good thought to compare **b7 vs c8**, but don\u2019t choose just by \u201cflips 5.\u201d\n\nIn the endgame, ask: **what does White get next?**\n\n- **b7** flips a lot, but it\u2019s next to the empty **a8 corner**, so check whether White can use that.\n- **c8** also flips a lot, but ask whether White can immediately play on the bottom edge and flip some back.\n\nTry looking one move ahead: after each, what legal moves would White have, especially near **a8/b8**?", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T12:39:41.324456+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T12:39:42.908484+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Metacomment"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Metacomment"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Conversational Acknowledgment": 3, "Metacomment": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Conversational Acknowledgment": 1.0, "Metacomment": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Metacomment"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Metacomment"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint", "Prompt", "Positive Feedback", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 2, "Hint": 3, "Prompt": 3, "Positive Feedback": 2, "Neutral Feedback": 2, "Paraphrase": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 0.6666666666666666, "Hint": 1.0, "Prompt": 1.0, "Positive Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Neutral Feedback": 0.6666666666666666, "Paraphrase": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model":